<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Mahmud IV</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. c. 1610</span> · <a href="/centuries/17th-century">17th century</a> · Also known as Mansa Mahmud IV</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Mahmud IV was the last <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mansa">mansa</a> of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mali-empire">Mali Empire</a>. By his time the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/keita-dynasty">Keita dynasty</a> controlled little beyond its <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kangaba">Kangaba</a> heartland. His death around 1610 marked the effective end of the Mali Empire as a coherent political entity.</p></div>
